{%- doc -%}
  The three promises, shown wherever a shopper is deciding: under the heading of
  an empty cart, and directly above the checkout button once there is something
  in it — the drawer's and the cart page's alike.

  The wording is the shop's own, not the cart's invention: "משלוח חינם תמיד" and
  the 30-day return are what the משלוחים-והחזרות page and the announcement bar
  say, so the cart cannot promise a shopper something the policy does not back.
  Change a promise here and it changes in every cart at once — and change the
  policy page in the same breath.

  Icons are inline so they cost no request and inherit the colour.
{%- enddoc -%}

